<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま早く開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "500" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>! Get away from <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> right now! You'll get killed!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I yelled as I burst into the second-floor room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\戦い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Sure enough, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had her knives at the ready...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> were </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s pawns, and they carried out the curse-killings!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s parents have been killed, so now we're in danger too...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">...! Could it be you heard!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was sitting beside </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But what is this? These guys are way too relaxed!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Saying "could it be" means </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> have figured it out too, right!?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="7">, wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had come after me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was unfazed too. How could she be!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Why does everyone know </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> are pawns and still not feel any danger...!?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="7">! Listen to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's gotten into everybody!! These two are murderers, aren't they!? 
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> can move like that so they could kill <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents, right!? 
{PAUSE ""}
　We know now, don't we! Let's just get the cops to arrest them already! 
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, get out of here, quick! <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>'s a murderer!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ビンタ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "12" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">A hard blow struck my cheek.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">For an instant, my mind went blank.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Not because it hurt enough to make my mind go blank.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">It was because, the instant before the blow, I understood what was about to happen to me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ビンタ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">But I couldn't believe it right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Because it was the first time in my life it had ever happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ぶ">hit</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">You only raise a hand to a kid when the kid's done something bad, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I... I haven't done anything bad...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">At the sound of the slap, the room went silent in an instant.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And the next moment,</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬抱きしめる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I was held tight in </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s arms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">In that moment, I realized my thinking was wrong.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Not that some logic that could prove it had come to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s attitude was all it took.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>... sorry..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I'd apologized without even realizing it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Surely </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> hadn't killed anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Come to think of it, I still hadn't heard anything about </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> switching places.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">after she left Arata and learned about the outside world, for the first time she began to question what </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had taught her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> used to say it a lot, I hear. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'Get strong so you can take revenge on your </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="かたき">enemy</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Back in Arata she didn't know anything about the world, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> finally realized that was wrong. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">And she told me. That it might have been </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> who did it..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"But... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> still hasn't told </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> to kill anyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So those two haven't done anything. Just like everyone else, they were only </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="3">, I heard too. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> did all of it, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So I'm gonna protect everyone! I'm strong!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Always goofing around, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had never shown me this side of her before.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Just what you'd expect of </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s daughter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">However much anyone tries to dirty them, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> won't let their hearts be dirtied.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> are both daughters of the Goddess.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Everyone! We'd better get away from Arata as fast as we can! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, into the car, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Got it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, what about you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... I'll follow the car and cover you! There may still be Arata residents down near the foot of the mountain! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, help me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Okay! I'll do my best!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> could </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> the residents into attacking us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">In that case, there's no point staying here long.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">We have to get out as soon as possible.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">We'd all come here together for </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s thirteenth-year memorial service, and now... [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm sorry.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But now that we've come this far, solving the curse-killings has to be close.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">So once things settle down, I'll come see you again...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "281" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "50"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村家車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">I grabbed whatever luggage I could get my hands on and climbed into the car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Everyone! We're going back to Motoki-cho now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The tires haven't been punctured, have they!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Right now </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s checking them!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, the tires are fine!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Like we thought, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wasn't in the house!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... So he's setting something up after all...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, go, right now!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
