<STYLE ID="4">Slicing through the storm of cherry petals blown all the way from the Niimura main house in the distance, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> were flying along both sides of the forest road.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Unlike the car, which had slowed down and was weaving along, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and her sister went in straight lines through the gaps between the trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">It took a mountain they knew well and outstanding reflexes, but this way they could keep pace with the car.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">But... </STYLE>
