<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Besides, there'd been no sign of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> this whole time, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was supposedly keeping watch at the foot of the mountain.</STYLE>
