<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">In that one instant, from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...!?</STYLE>
