{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had collapsed onto the ground where she stood too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">I couldn't follow that movement with my eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The way </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> moved earlier was nothing compared to it...!</STYLE>
