<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, come here. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'re still a child. Stay by Daddy's side."</STYLE>
