{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I knew it. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">just a fake big sis. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">My real sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> are who I want."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No...!"</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>! Apologize to <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>! Kid or not, I'm not letting what you just said slide!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> just stayed where she was, standing beside </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"There, there. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you're a good girl after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> gave </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s head a </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="な">pat</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
