<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what are you doing! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> aren't supposed to use it!"</STYLE><PG>
