{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's true! This drug's amazing! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　With this, I think I can save everyone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
