{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Y... you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> crouched, clutching his stomach, as a large amount of blood dripped down.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you always used to say it, didn't you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s killer, I was supposed to get strong to pay them back, you said. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">When I found the culprit, I was supposed to take revenge on </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s enemy, you said. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">did it, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> dropped her gaze to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> as he crouched there, staring down at him.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was a bad person after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPS>"Ngh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"I kept thinking and thinking. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> being the culprit is something I don't want to believe. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But... someone in this settlement is the culprit, no doubt about it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> could be the culprit too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Why won't you do what I say...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"Who would it have to be for me to be okay with it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Is it fine as long as it's not family? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　If it was family... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">what should I do? Is it okay to just leave it alone and abandon everyone?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPS>"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">ngh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"That's not okay. </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s killer can't be forgiven, and neither can the culprit behind the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If the culprit is family... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">if they've been </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> us the whole time... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If the culprit is </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would be the one I could forgive least."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I wanted to believe in </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> till the very end. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> always, always mattered so much to me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I thought, would save everyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But if you're going to do things like this, I have to face reality too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'re... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">wrong...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"The one who's most wrong is </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Not just the people in the settlement, now it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how many people are you going to kill? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Are you going to kill even more people from now on? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Will you be satisfied once you've killed dozens, hundreds of people? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Then... I have no choice but to stop you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">'Cause I'm strong. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">'Cause I want to save everyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... any more than this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">'cause I don't want you to be a bad person."</STYLE><PG>
